# The pinned single-file binaries in .tooling/bin, in sha256sum(1) format, with paths
# relative to the REPOSITORY ROOT. Check with:  sha256sum -c crooks-assistant/docs/dev-environment/binaries.sha256
#
# These began as OBSERVED digests, read off the artifacts installed on the builder at candidate
# 9a27bc441adad1e98e8a9ca257d1883246ee7eec. On 2026-09-19, under the owner's approved bounded
# fetch policy, every asset pinned in manifest.json was fetched from its upstream release and
# extracted, and all NINE digests below were reproduced exactly. They are therefore no longer
# observation alone: the bytes this environment was proved against are the bytes those releases
# contain. A reconstruction that fetches something else fails loudly instead of running a
# different tool at the same version number.
#
# The digests of the downloaded assets themselves are in binary-assets.sha256, which is checked
# before extraction; this file is checked after install.
#
# .tooling/bin/skillspector is deliberately absent: it is a uv-generated shim with the
# checkout's absolute path baked into its shebang, so its digest is path-dependent and
# would be wrong in any other checkout. Its identity is the uv_tools pin in manifest.json.

